@host = http://localhost:5080
# Genera ambos tokens con scripts/token.ps1. No guardes valores reales en Git.
@adminToken = REEMPLAZAR_TOKEN_ADMIN
@studentToken = REEMPLAZAR_TOKEN_STUDENT
@productId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@productVersion = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@orderId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@orderVersion = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 200 sin token
GET {{host}}/health/ready

### 401 sin token
GET {{host}}/api/v1/products

### Crear producto como Admin: 201 + Location; copiar id/version
POST {{host}}/api/v1/products
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sku": "CURSO-001", "name": "Arquitectura con IA", "price": 125.50 }

### Catálogo paginado
GET {{host}}/api/v1/products?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### Cache Aside
GET {{host}}/api/v1/products/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### Concurrencia: primer PUT 200; repetir Version anterior 409
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/products/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sku": "CURSO-001", "name": "Arquitectura empresarial con IA", "price": 150.00, "version": "{{productVersion}}" }

### 201: precio y cliente los decide el servidor; copiar id/version
POST {{host}}/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "items": [ { "productId": "{{productId}}", "quantity": 2 } ] }

### Sólo pedidos del subject autenticado
GET {{host}}/api/v1/orders?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### Otro subject: 403
GET {{host}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### 200 cancelación; luego repetir con versión vieja: 409
POST {{host}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "version": "{{orderVersion}}" }

### Borrado lógico; versión actual requerida
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/products/{{productId}}?version={{productVersion}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
